      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really? i thought steroids helped with inflammation. the patch is actually starting to feel kinda tender now and there's a little bit of a dull ache in my leg near it. i'm kinda worried it's more than just ringworm... but i'm really busy with work and can't really go to an urgent care right now. do u think it's possible it's just an inflammatory reaction to the fungus? like, could i just take some ibuprofen and keep the cream on for a few more days to see if the ache goes away?",
